Subject: honor custom-model context window for auto-compact
Decision: additionalModels/profile contextWindowMaxTokens is source of truth; set CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS and CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW with overwrite; match gateway-prefixed and case-insensitive ids; do not shrink the Paseo meter below the configured window
Verify: npx vitest run packages/server/src/server/agent/providers/claude/models.test.ts packages/server/src/server/agent/providers/claude/agent.env.test.ts --bail=1
Files: packages/server/src/server/agent/providers/claude/models.ts
Files: packages/server/src/server/agent/providers/claude/agent.ts
Files: packages/server/src/server/agent/providers/claude/models.test.ts
Files: packages/server/src/server/agent/providers/claude/agent.env.test.ts

From 8b5a44f04613967b0787cffa1be44be63aab85bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Riajul Islam <kmriajulislami@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 17:21:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(claude): honor custom-model context window for
 auto-compact

Profile/additional-model capacity was fill-if-missing, so a host
CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_CONTEXT_TOKENS (or Claude Code's assumed 200k on
unrecognized IDs) kept auto-compact firing at the old window. Match
gateway-prefixed and case-insensitive model ids, overwrite env from
the configured model, and don't shrink the Paseo meter to the assumed
window.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
